  "description": "Hyunsoo falls in love with the campus idol, Kwon Jiwon, at the freshman welcoming party. But Jiwon suddenly disappears a week before summer vacation and appears again... As a cat?! A cute romantic comedy of an adorable couple who struggle to change Jiwon back to normal. \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated) \n\n*Note: Part of Kidari Entertainment's \"Yeoreumdanpyeonseon: Some in Summer (~키다리이엔티 여름단편선~ 썸인썸머, Kidari Entertainment Summer Short Story Collection: Some in Summer)\"*",
